Autoupgrade - Middleware on update Part Details Component : Core Status : [TEST] IN PROGRESS Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-5609 Specification : https://forge.prestashop.com/browse/SUE-310 Steps Step Description Expected result Go to &ldquo;Update Assistant&rdquo; module (side board). &ldquo;Update Assistant&rdquo; module is displayed : * Title : &ldquo;Welcome to PrestaShop Update Assistant&rdquo;
* Two radio buttons : &ldquo;Update your store&rdquo; and &ldquo;Restore from a backup&rdquo; (disabled)
* CTA &ldquo;Get started&rdquo; disabled Select the radio button &ldquo;Update your store&rdquo;.

